1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:03,100
Memorize daily duas, a little at a time.
Four simple steps.

2
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:06,300
Step 1 of 4: Listen.
Play phrase by phrase, slowed down if you like.

3
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:09,500
Step 2 of 4: Build.
Add one phrase per round and repeat it aloud.

4
00:00:09,800 --> 00:00:13,100
Step 3 of 4: Recall.
Hide 30, 60, then 100% of the words.

5
00:00:13,400 --> 00:00:16,700
Step 4 of 4: Check.
Tap the words you missed and rate yourself honestly.

6
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:19,900
Reviewed when it’s due.
The next review is scheduled for you.

7
00:00:20,300 --> 00:00:23,300
Light or dark.
Easy to read, day and night.

8
00:00:26,200 --> 00:00:28,600
